[38;5;246m[48;5;237m❯ [38;5;231mAfterwards also add a one-line summary.[39m

[38;5;231m[49m●[39m Terminal multiplexers keep shells alive by owning the PTY masters on a long-lived server, emulating each pane's screen
  in memory, and letting disposable clients attach and detach over a Unix socket.

